11
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:43,566
Don't overthink it alone. Just ask me.

12
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,800
Ah Tan, I like you. Can we stop hiding?

13
00:00:51,733 --> 00:00:53,966
Once I clear it up, we won't have to hide.

14
00:00:54,966 --> 00:00:55,500
Wait again?

15
00:00:56,266 --> 00:00:57,766
What else are you afraid to tell me?
